  "components": [
    {
      "id": "activity",
      "name": "Activity",
      "version": "1.12.0-rc01",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/activity#1.12.0-rc01",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fix runtime failures for <code>BackHandler</code> and <code>PredictiveBackHandler</code> in apps using custom Activity classes. These composables now safely fall back to <code>LocalOnBackPressedDispatcherOwner</code> while preserving dispatch order in apps that support <code>NavigationEventDispatcherOwner</code>. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I43873459dbaa00b35fbf22f6fc5e9172f97198d2\">I43873</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/46bcdef6281ae0f03c3a2bb2812edfc2c0e66d05..bcc8bee1eb595dcb47e9d7acf0379692cc49061f/activity"
    },
    {
      "id": "appfunctions",
      "name": "Appfunctions",
      "version": "1.0.0-alpha06",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/appfunctions#1.0.0-alpha06",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>New Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Support embedding resource as part of AppFunction response</li>\n <li>Allow using <code>FLAG_GRANT_PERSISTABLE_URI_PERMISSION</code> in <code>AppFunctionUriGrant</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>API Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Add <code>ResourceHolder</code> API (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I08c1cd97978c0a1008a4d06a4dec7411f74d399c\">I08c1c</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/447530724\">b/447530724</a>)</li>\n <li>Add <code>AppFunctionTextResource</code> API (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I7d54f8f56818addcc43de8bf20960a5a62c4f48d\">I7d54f</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/447530724\">b/447530724</a>)</li>\n <li>Add <code>AppFunctionOneOfTypeMetadata</code> API (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I12c67479b526332fa58a03164ccb51cd5daddcd6\">I12c67</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/449915612\">b/449915612</a>)</li>\n <li>Drop Compat suffix from Service APIs. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Ib9291c5faeb6caf1dac723b81b7642350f812674\">Ib9291</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/449797980\">b/449797980</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/449797980\">b/449797980</a>)</li>\n <li>Support build <code>AppFunctionData</code> from <code>AllOfType</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Ib11763755ead6155aaa8919779ffc262e1d69227\">Ib1176</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/447535093\">b/447535093</a>)</li>\n <li>Add get/set Parcelable API(s) in <code>AppFunctionData</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I3aec78ef958a7c9d26d430b1033f51bbbe903de0\">I3aec7</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/447530985\">b/447530985</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fix the issue that ignoring nullable required field would fail when constructing <code>AppFunctionData</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/support/+/3791966\">I52195</a>)</li>\n <li>Fix the issue that using <code>List&lt;PendingIntent&gt;</code> with <code>AppFunction</code> would fail at compile time (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/support/+/3795955\">Iebde7</a>)</li>\n <li>Fix the issue that <code>ByteArray</code>’s metadata was generated incorrectly as <code>List&lt;ByteArray&gt;</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/support/+/3810704\">I2e499</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/dac153545321dddc78a0fe286c86be49f86de8f6..a3cfe112d4f736e9cd9dd1c4b222448bfcc3cfa4/appfunctions"
    },
