    {
      "id": "core-backported-fixes",
      "name": "Core-backported-fixes",
      "version": "1.0.0-beta02",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/core#core-backported-fixes-1.0.0-beta02",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>API Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Add known issue b/452390376 (<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#CONTROL_AE_MODE_ON_LOW_LIGHT_BOOST_BRIGHTNESS_PRIORITY\">Auto Exposure Mode Low Light Boost (LLB)</a>) cannot be enabled for stream use cases such as VIDEO_CALL on Pixel 10 devices. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Iba4803d52c9c93b88694aceb7d218b4c7a0e77f0\">Iba480</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/452390376\">b/452390376</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Mark specific pixel builds as fixed. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I4c7519189c6fd1a792333925e0a1bd3cbb37c712\">I4c751</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/398591036\">b/398591036</a>)</li>\n <li>Add support for specifying a list of manually tested build fingerprints for a KnownIssue. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Iea9f9f14a4c81a66689552d59ecaf2b41f02c494\">Iea9f9</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/453691379\">b/453691379</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/3ee4b76dd7f79cd4ce3fbe7aa76816fec0b8186a..9b6dee951e595dec2015b7b31a9591a22f7ea265/core/core-backported-fixes"
    },
