      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Improve <code>TimePicker</code> number visibility on small screens (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I70fbe12cda89485cab14f5bb17004b12a5c7d5ba\">I70fbe</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
